# ─────────────────────────────────────────
# GROCERIES  (image + slip supported)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────

### Add Grocery (JSON)
POST {{baseUrl}}/expenses/grocery
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "item": "Milk",
  "quantity": 2,
  "price": 35.99,
  "store": "Checkers",
  "onSale": true
}

###

### Add Grocery (with file upload — use Postman or form-data)
# POST {{baseUrl}}/expenses/grocery
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
# Content-Type: multipart/form-data
# Fields: item, quantity, price, store, onSale, image (file), slip (file)

### Get All Groceries
GET {{baseUrl}}/expenses/grocery
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Delete Grocery
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/expenses/grocery/EXPENSE_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

